"CAB 会先请求正常退出；超时后只会强制结束身份未变化的上述 Codex 进程。请先保存任务内容。" = "CAB first requests a normal exit. After the timeout, it force stops only the unchanged Codex processes listed above. Save your work first.";
"VS Code 的 Codex 扩展仍在运行（PID %@）。它可能拒绝退出或被 VS Code 自动重新启动；请先在 VS Code 中停止该扩展或退出 VS Code，然后重试。" = "The Codex extension in VS Code is still running (PID %@). It may have refused to exit or been restarted by VS Code. Stop the extension or quit VS Code, then try again.";
"仍有 Codex 进程未退出（PID %@）。" = "Codex processes are still running (PID %@).";
"切换桌面账号时同步项目、完整消息、记忆、目标、技能、附件、侧栏状态和未发送草稿。" = "Sync projects, complete messages, memories, goals, skills, attachments, sidebar state, and unsent drafts when switching desktop accounts.";
"切换桌面账号时保持各账号自己的项目列表和任务历史。" = "Keep each account's own project list and task history when switching desktop accounts.";
"服务器上的账号共用任务历史，其中可能包含其他账号的上下文。" = "Accounts on the server share task history, which may include context from another account.";
"服务器上的每个账号保持独立任务历史。" = "Each account on the server keeps separate task history.";
"开启后，下次切换桌面账号前 CAB 会先检查 CLI 和编辑器扩展；确认没有任务写入后才关闭桌面端，再同步项目、完整消息、目标、记忆、个人技能、规则、附件、侧栏状态、提示历史和未发送草稿。其他账号可能看到这些内容，但登录凭据、插件授权、设备连接和安全权限始终独立。" = "When enabled, CAB checks the CLI and editor extensions before the next desktop account switch. It closes the desktop app only after confirming that no task is writing, then syncs projects, complete messages, goals, memories, personal skills, rules, attachments, sidebar state, prompt history, and unsent drafts. Other accounts may see this content, while credentials, plugin authorization, device connections, and security permissions remain separate.";
"关闭后，下次切换桌面账号时 CAB 会保持每个账号自己的项目列表，并恢复独立的任务历史副本。登录凭据不会改变。" = "When disabled, the next desktop account switch keeps each account's own project list and restores its separate task history copy. Credentials are unchanged.";
"操作前必须退出服务器上的所有 Codex 进程。共享后不同账号可以看到同一份任务历史，其中可能包含另一个账号的上下文。" = "All Codex processes on the server must exit first. Once shared, different accounts can see the same task history, which may include context from another account.";
"会先检查 CLI 和编辑器扩展，再安全同步项目、完整消息与目录、记忆、目标、个人技能、附件、侧栏状态和未发送草稿；预检不通过时不会关闭桌面端。" = "CAB first checks the CLI and editor extensions, then safely syncs projects, complete messages and catalogs, memories, goals, personal skills, attachments, sidebar state, and unsent drafts. The desktop app stays open if the preflight check fails.";
"如果当前正在共享，会先恢复各账号独立的会话副本；项目列表也保持账号独立。" = "If sharing is currently enabled, CAB first restores each account's separate session copy; project lists also remain account-specific.";
"这会关闭正在运行的 Codex 桌面客户端和其中的活动任务，再以所选账号的独立 CODEX_HOME 重新启动。%@请先保存正在进行的工作。" = "This closes the running Codex desktop app and its active tasks, then restarts it with the selected account's separate CODEX_HOME. %@Save your work first.";

